# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects execution of "rundll32.exe" with a parent process of Explorer.exe. This has been observed by variants of Raspberry Robin, as first reported by Red Canary.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((Image="*\\rundll32.exe") OR (OriginalFileName == "RUNDLL32.EXE")) AND (ParentImage="*\\explorer.exe")) AND NOT (((CommandLine CONTAINS " C:\\Windows\\System32\\") OR (CommandLine="* -localserver 22d8c27b-47a1-48d1-ad08-7da7abd79617"))))
